**Copyright:** © 2026 Gonzalo Martínez García. All rights reserved.
**Contact:** legal@gonzaloapps.es

This agreement governs use of the **application** License Generator, the
desktop tool that creates signing keys and issues signed licenses for your own
software. Where a store imposes its own end user terms, those apply in addition
to these; where they conflict, the store's terms prevail for installations
obtained through that store.

## 1. Licence granted

The Licensor grants you a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable licence to
install and use License Generator on devices you own or control, to create
signing keys and to issue, inspect and manage licenses for software applications
that you own or are authorised to license.

You may distribute the licenses and public keys you generate to your own
customers, as part of your commercial or free applications, and you may profit
from the sale of your applications that use them. You keep full ownership of
your applications and of the license data you generate.

The application is licensed, not sold. You acquire no ownership in it.

The licence is granted free of charge. It is perpetual, requires no renewal,
and carries no fees.

**Voluntary contributions.** The application offers a way to support the
project. Any contribution you choose to make is voluntary and does not change
this licence: it does not buy the application, a feature or any right, and it
grants no entitlement to support, updates or any other service.

## 2. Integration examples

The files under `docs/examples` published with the application's
